{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"量子Heisenberg模型"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"“量子 Heisenberg 模型”"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>#数学物理</p>\n<p>Hilbert 空间为 $(\\mathbb{C}^2)^{\\otimes N}$, Hamilton 量为\n$$\r\n\\hat H = -J \\sum_{j=1}^N \\sigma_j \\sigma_{j+1} - h \\sum_{j=1}^N \\sigma_j\\,(\\sigma_{N+1}=\\sigma_1).\r\n$$\n$$\r\n\\hat{H}=-\\frac{1}{2}\\sum_{j=1}^{N}(J_x\\sigma_j^x\\sigma_{j+1}^x+J_y\\sigma_j^y\\sigma_{j+1}^y+J_z\\sigma_j^z\\sigma_{j+1}^z+h\\sigma_j^z).\r\n$$\n见 "},{"Local":{"url":"Pauli矩阵","text":"Pauli 矩阵"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"AKLT模型","text":"AKLT 模型"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}